<title>INDONESIA: Mulialand 9-mth net doubles.</title>
<headline>Mulialand 9-mth net doubles.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian property firm PT Mulialand said on Wednesday that it had posted a net profit in the nine months ending September of 115.9 billion rupiah against 53.26 billion rupiah in the same period last year.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that it was confident of achieving the 1996 net profit target of 140 billion rupiah.</p>
<p>&quot;With strong sales in office space, retail mall Taman Anggrek and efficiency in financing, Mulialand can reach the net profit target,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
